+	# OAUTH PROTECTED-RESOURCE DOCUMENTS, STRAIGHT TO THE CONTAINER WITH THE HOST HEADER INTACT.
+	# The Next.js rewrite that proxies /.well-known/* replaces Host with api.hatchloop.dev, and the origin builds
+	# the document's `resource` from Host, so a door's metadata named the API host instead of the URL the client
